WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:07,810
Everyone performed well in the copy

2
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:08,810
The pollution here is too heavy

3
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:10,840
Staying for too long is not good for ordinary people.

4
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:11,840
Let's withdraw first

5
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:14,000
What do you think? It’s great

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,770
The world is back to normal

7
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:45,810
It's time to take a break

8
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:50,180
No problem, okay, Uncle Zhao

9
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:51,540
Find some people who can cook

10
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:53,540
Let’s all eat local meat tonight

11
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:54,540
I'll take someone to get it right now
